depending on their personal sense of aesthetics.  For instance, I find
some treatments of animals rather disgusting, like when sadists hack off
puppys' tails and throw them (puppys) onto fires, or use crossbows to
shoot bolts through cats' skulls, or slash horses for some sort of
gratification.  And the milking of Asian bears for their bile is almost
